                "text": "Colorado is home to over 400,000 veterans who have protected the freedoms we all cherish. But for years, many of our veterans weren\u2019t getting the care they needed.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nOur PACT Act has delivered support and treatment to those veterans who need it.  https://t.co/pVmw4iEVk8",
